WEBVTT

00:02.880 --> 00:06.420
<b>I swear... you're always putting me to work.</b>

00:06.420 --> 00:09.580
<b>The way you rush in there like a lunatic...</b>

00:09.580 --> 00:11.630
<b>Thanks for the assist, Fred.</b>

00:12.040 --> 00:15.080
<b>Without you, I'd have been dead
a long time ago.</b>

00:15.080 --> 00:16.710
<b>Obviously...</b>

00:16.710 --> 00:19.290
<b>And you're not the only one.</b>

00:19.290 --> 00:22.540
<b>But you are a bigger pain in the ass than most.</b>

00:22.790 --> 00:24.000
<b>Here.</b>

00:25.130 --> 00:26.580
<b>What is it?</b>

00:26.580 --> 00:30.080
<b>If you're faced with low-level magic,
that amulet will counteract it.</b>

00:30.080 --> 00:31.960
<b>Oughtta put your mind at ease.</b>

00:31.960 --> 00:34.790
<b>Wait, really? Thanks a ton, Fred!</b>

00:35.040 --> 00:35.750
<b>Ow.</b>

00:35.750 --> 00:39.170
<b>Use it so I'm not constantly
having to heal you. Got it?</b>

00:41.540 --> 00:43.000
<b>Oh please...</b>

00:43.000 --> 00:45.250
<b>Why can't Fred just be honest for once?</b>

00:46.960 --> 00:51.130
<b>Yeah, I agree. He could stand to be a little
less abrasive with his choice of words.</b>

00:51.630 --> 00:54.000
<b>But Leo's not any better.</b>

00:54.000 --> 00:56.080
<b>He's way too reckless...</b>

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
<b>It's like he doesn't even realize
how much Fred worries about him.</b>

01:00.380 --> 01:03.080
<b>All that strength, and yet he's got
zero emotional intelligence...</b>

01:03.080 --> 01:04.080
<b>Whaddya think?
</b><b>All that strength, and yet he's got</b><b>
</b><b>zero emotional intelligence...</b><b></b>

01:04.080 --> 01:06.540
<b>You don't have to wear it. Put it away.
</b><b>Fred's going to blow up on him eventually.</b><b></b>

01:06.790 --> 01:08.960
<b>Awfully perceptive, aren't you?</b>

01:10.670 --> 01:12.830
<b>But so long as they keep flirting with
each other, they should be fine.</b>

01:12.830 --> 01:13.710
<b>Knock it off!
</b><b>But so long as they keep flirting with</b><b>
</b><b>each other, they should be fine.</b><b></b>

01:13.710 --> 01:14.210
<b>Hm?
</b><b>But so long as they keep flirting with</b><b>
</b><b>each other, they should be fine.</b><b></b>

01:14.210 --> 01:14.830
<b>Cut it out!</b>

01:14.830 --> 01:15.420
<b>What's the problem?
</b><b>Flirting...?</b><b></b>

01:15.420 --> 01:16.080
<b>Stop that!
</b><b>Flirting...?</b><b></b>

01:16.080 --> 01:16.880
<b>Whaddya mean?</b>

01:16.880 --> 01:21.380
<b>If anything ever happens, you're going to
have to play referee. You know that, right?</b>

01:21.380 --> 01:23.630
<b>Me? Really...?</b>

01:23.960 --> 01:25.330
<b>I dunno...</b>

01:25.330 --> 01:27.250
<b>Seems like a big responsibility.</b>

01:27.250 --> 01:30.130
<b>I'm counting on you, Max.</b>

01:31.330 --> 01:33.250
<b>Delivery Room</b>

01:35.080 --> 01:38.290
<b>Things are gettin' pretty dicey
between the Hero and his friends.</b>

01:38.290 --> 01:40.540
<b>Now's not the time for a play-by-play, Sara!</b>

01:40.540 --> 01:42.500
<b>I'M the one who's about to explode!</b>

01:42.750 --> 01:46.080
<b>You okay, honey?!
Just hang in there a little longer!</b>

03:19.380 --> 03:25.380
<b>#11 The Hero, Covered in Mud</b>

03:25.540 --> 03:27.920
<b>Wh-what the...?!
Something fell from the sky!</b>

03:27.920 --> 03:29.630
<b>Is that...?</b>

03:29.920 --> 03:32.130
<b>You have got to be kidding me...</b>

03:36.290 --> 03:38.080
<b>Who the heck is he?</b>

03:38.080 --> 03:40.670
<b>I feel like I know him from somewhere...</b>

03:40.670 --> 03:44.040
<b>Wait a minute, is that... Max the Hero?</b>

03:44.040 --> 03:46.630
<b>No way! Why does he look so old?</b>

03:46.630 --> 03:48.210
<b>He aged like milk...</b>

03:51.920 --> 03:53.500
<b>Gimme a break...</b>

03:53.500 --> 03:55.170
<b>That hurt like hell...</b>

03:55.580 --> 03:57.790
<b>Maybe I shouldn't have come...</b>

03:58.290 --> 04:00.630
<b>Too old for this shit, I swear...</b>

04:01.040 --> 04:02.040
<b>Mr. Minister!</b>

04:02.040 --> 04:05.540
<b>Do you believe Chief Secretary Fred has
been thrown under the proverbial bus?</b>

04:05.790 --> 04:09.000
<b>That is not my understanding of
the present circumstances.</b>

04:09.000 --> 04:12.880
<b>If worst comes to worst,
the Royal Army is prepared to act.</b>

04:12.880 --> 04:16.170
<b>And what would be the worst-case
scenario in this situation?</b>

04:16.170 --> 04:20.000
<b>Is it possible, in your opinion,
that the Kingdom proper is in danger?</b>

04:20.250 --> 04:23.540
<b>No. The situation poses absolutely
no threat to the lives</b>

04:23.540 --> 04:26.000
<b>or safety of the Kingdom's
citizens at this time.</b>

04:26.000 --> 04:29.000
<b>I urge everyone to remain calm and
continue about your business as usual-</b>

04:30.380 --> 04:34.960
<b>Mr. Minister! Max has just appeared at
the scene of the battle between Leo and Fred!</b>

04:36.670 --> 04:39.830
<b>Y'see, little missy? What'd I tell ya?</b>

04:39.830 --> 04:43.960
<b>Th-this is perfect! Now if we can
just get Max to stop Leo...!</b>

04:43.960 --> 04:46.920
<b>You say that as if it's gonna be easy.</b>

04:46.920 --> 04:50.130
<b>Max is no spring chicken,
and even if he does win...</b>

04:50.130 --> 04:53.830
<b>I can't imagine he would suddenly
bend to the will of the Kingdom.</b>

04:54.380 --> 04:55.880
<b>Ignore her.</b>

04:55.880 --> 04:57.750
<b>Look, it's starting!</b>

04:59.500 --> 05:01.960
<b>Why bother showing up now...?</b>

05:02.960 --> 05:06.670
<b>The mighty Hero, come to
rescue a kingdom in crisis?</b>

05:06.670 --> 05:08.500
<b>"A kingdom in crisis"?</b>

05:08.500 --> 05:10.210
<b>Don't flatter yourself!</b>

05:10.210 --> 05:12.960
<b>You're not nearly as big a deal
as you seem to think you are!</b>

05:13.290 --> 05:15.920
<b>I'll take you both on, if need be.</b>

05:16.380 --> 05:18.380
<b>To protect this land and its people!</b>

05:18.630 --> 05:20.460
<b>Acting righteous, are we...?</b>

05:20.460 --> 05:23.630
<b>All you and your little criminal pals did
was seize this land illegally!</b>

05:23.790 --> 05:26.750
<b>The Kingdom is the one who
tried to steal our land unfairly!</b>

05:26.750 --> 05:28.630
<b>Even you ought to be able to see-</b>

05:28.630 --> 05:30.750
<b>SHUDDUP! BOTH OF YA!</b>

05:31.330 --> 05:33.170
<b>"Kingdom" this, "Republic" that...</b>

05:33.170 --> 05:36.000
<b>It's just one dumbass excuse
after another, ain't it?</b>

05:36.000 --> 05:38.170
<b>I'm sick of hearin' you two yammer on!</b>

05:38.420 --> 05:40.750
<b>I'll squash the BOTH of ya...</b>

05:40.750 --> 05:43.130
<b>That way, I ain't gotta look atcha!</b>

05:45.380 --> 05:46.380
<b>Huh?!</b>

05:47.330 --> 05:50.170
<b>Yup, I could've told you that was coming...</b>

05:51.040 --> 05:55.540
<b>Now, let's sit back and enjoy
the mudslinging contest...</b>

05:55.750 --> 05:57.540
<b>"Dumbass excuses"?</b>

05:57.540 --> 05:59.040
<b>Are you kidding me?!</b>

05:59.040 --> 06:01.380
<b>What would a loser like you know anyway?!</b>

06:01.830 --> 06:04.330
<b>Try minding your own damn business!</b>

06:04.710 --> 06:06.790
<b>Yeah, ya got a point...</b>

06:07.130 --> 06:10.540
<b>Whatever it is yer fightin' for,
I really don't give a shit...</b>

06:10.540 --> 06:12.790
<b>But ya pissed me off,
so now it's personal!</b>

06:12.790 --> 06:14.040
<b>That's all there is to it!</b>

06:14.040 --> 06:15.750
<b>Go to hell, ya dumb bastards!</b>

06:16.130 --> 06:18.420
<b>I don't fully understand what's going on...</b>

06:18.420 --> 06:22.290
<b>but it seems like you didn't come here
as Fred's backup, am I right?</b>

06:33.170 --> 06:36.750
<b>Well then... that's just fine by me.</b>

06:45.630 --> 06:49.040
<b>There's only one rule:
Last man standing wins.</b>

06:51.790 --> 06:53.920
<b>Might as well keep it simple, right?!</b>

06:53.920 --> 06:56.380
<b>Bring it, Max! C'mon, Fred!</b>

06:57.880 --> 06:59.540
<b>Goddamn idiots!</b>

06:59.540 --> 07:01.960
<b>I'll teach you a lesson the hard way!</b>

07:33.630 --> 07:35.420
<b>Splendid.</b>

07:35.420 --> 07:37.830
<b>This video shall prove most valuable.</b>

07:37.830 --> 07:41.130
<b>Though all we can do at the moment is watch...</b>

07:41.420 --> 07:43.330
<b>What are your thoughts, Zeeman?</b>

07:43.330 --> 07:46.250
<b>Perhaps it's punishment for
our actions thus far...</b>

07:49.420 --> 07:51.080
<b>What's the matter, Max?!</b>

07:51.080 --> 07:53.000
<b>Lookin' a little slow!</b>

07:55.960 --> 07:58.210
<b>SHUT UP!</b>

08:07.830 --> 08:08.920
<b>Huh?</b>

08:24.670 --> 08:28.130
<b>You talked a big game...
and even whipped out the Holy Blade...</b>

08:36.540 --> 08:39.170
<b>So what in the hell was that, Max?!</b>

08:39.670 --> 08:41.380
<b>Oh, gimme a break...</b>

08:41.380 --> 08:44.040
<b>It's been a decade since I last did this crap.</b>

08:44.130 --> 08:47.710
<b>D'ya honestly expect me to be
light on my feet forever...?</b>

08:47.710 --> 08:49.130
<b>But we're the same age...</b>

08:49.130 --> 08:50.580
<b>You stay out of this.</b>

08:51.040 --> 08:52.960
<b>What a disappointment.</b>

08:52.960 --> 08:54.790
<b>"Hero," my ass...</b>

08:54.790 --> 08:56.250
<b>How ridiculous...</b>

08:56.250 --> 08:58.830
<b>Don't make an even bigger fool of yourself!</b>

08:58.830 --> 09:01.210
<b>I'll put you in the ground right now!</b>

09:44.790 --> 09:46.290
<b>Max...</b>

09:47.500 --> 09:48.830
<b>Yikes...</b>

09:51.080 --> 09:53.500
<b>Is he dead, or...?</b>

09:53.500 --> 09:55.170
<b>Are we rolling?!
</b><b>Hey, what was that?!</b><b></b>

09:55.170 --> 09:56.460
<b>Get out of the way!</b>

09:59.040 --> 10:00.920
<b>It's no use...</b>

10:00.920 --> 10:03.210
<b>Ain't no way I can win.</b>

10:03.210 --> 10:05.330
<b>Shoulda known better from the start...</b>

10:05.330 --> 10:08.540
<b>Rushin' headlong into this fight
was a dumb idea...</b>

10:08.920 --> 10:10.750
<b>Don't give up!</b>

10:12.460 --> 10:13.540
<b>Huh...?</b>

10:19.210 --> 10:21.670
<b>L-Lord Behemoth...</b>

10:21.670 --> 10:24.330
<b>Take care of these guys, wouldja?</b>

10:40.130 --> 10:41.630
<b>Don't give up!</b>

10:41.790 --> 10:43.920
<b>"Don't give up," he says...</b>

10:43.920 --> 10:47.290
<b>Gonna need more than a pep talk, Max!</b>

10:47.750 --> 10:49.920
<b>How are we supposed to slay this thing?</b>

10:49.920 --> 10:52.130
<b>It's as big as a house...!</b>

10:52.380 --> 10:55.250
<b>So long as it's in the air,
not even Blazebringer can reach it!</b>

10:55.250 --> 10:58.880
<b>And our attack spells aren't very effective
at this range either...</b>

10:58.880 --> 11:00.920
<b>Picking a fight with a monster like that?</b>

11:00.920 --> 11:03.750
<b>We'd have to be totally out of our minds!</b>

11:03.750 --> 11:06.880
<b>Don't sweat it, guys!
I'LL be your shield!</b>

11:06.880 --> 11:09.670
<b>Have you forgotten who has to
heal you every single time?!</b>

11:09.670 --> 11:13.080
<b>How many more times can you
cast your healing magic?</b>

11:13.540 --> 11:15.880
<b>About four or five at most...</b>

11:15.880 --> 11:17.750
<b>and it's getting weaker...</b>

11:17.750 --> 11:22.130
<b>I swear, this is EXACTLY why I said we should
just leave the damn thing alone and-</b>

11:22.880 --> 11:25.380
<b>Dwelling on the past won't change it!</b>

11:25.380 --> 11:27.630
<b>So when Max tells us not to give up...</b>

11:28.210 --> 11:31.830
<b>...we fight with every last
ounce of strength we've got!</b>

11:31.830 --> 11:32.830
<b>Yuria...!</b>

11:32.830 --> 11:34.580
<b>That's the spirit, Yuria!</b>

11:34.580 --> 11:37.290
<b>I believe in Max and you and Fred!</b>

11:38.460 --> 11:42.670
<b>I'm assuming you have some sort of bite
to go along with that bark?</b>

11:42.670 --> 11:43.880
<b>I do.</b>

11:43.880 --> 11:46.540
<b>If my spells won't do the trick...</b>

11:47.080 --> 11:50.290
<b>...then I suppose our only
other choice is a sword.</b>

11:56.710 --> 11:58.250
<b>Open wide, Max.</b>

11:58.250 --> 11:59.250
<b>Huh?</b>

12:03.330 --> 12:05.330
<b>Maximum Drive.</b>

12:05.790 --> 12:10.210
<b>The full force of my magic,
condensed into a special buff.</b>

12:10.500 --> 12:12.750
<b>And just so you know,
you only get one shot.</b>

12:12.750 --> 12:15.330
<b>So finish it off while you
still have the chance!</b>

12:21.830 --> 12:23.460
<b>Go, Max!</b>

12:23.460 --> 12:25.790
<b>Kill it before the wall comes crumbling down!</b>

12:40.500 --> 12:42.380
<b>Persistent bastard...</b>

12:42.380 --> 12:44.210
<b>What, you want another beatdown?!</b>

13:03.790 --> 13:05.040
<b>Is that...?!</b>

13:44.960 --> 13:47.710
<b>Ah, so that's how it's gonna be...</b>

13:47.710 --> 13:49.540
<b>Brings back memories.</b>

13:49.540 --> 13:51.080
<b>It figures...</b>

13:51.080 --> 13:53.170
<b>Sticking her nose where it doesn't belong...</b>

13:54.000 --> 13:55.880
<b>Max, can you hear me?</b>

13:55.880 --> 13:58.080
<b>Yeah, I'm listenin'.</b>

13:58.250 --> 14:00.880
<b>No reply necessary.
This is just a recording.</b>

14:02.790 --> 14:04.290
<b>You remember, don't you?</b>

14:04.290 --> 14:07.630
<b>Maximum Drive isn't a long-lasting spell.</b>

14:07.630 --> 14:10.250
<b>I suggest you settle this
before its effects wear off.</b>

14:10.250 --> 14:14.250
<b>Then again, I'm sure those two
have figured that out by now...</b>

14:14.500 --> 14:15.920
<b>Probably...</b>

14:16.920 --> 14:19.540
<b>Sorry I couldn't be there to help in person...</b>

14:20.710 --> 14:24.380
<b>But we can't have a pregnant woman
running around on a battlefield, can we?</b>

14:24.380 --> 14:26.500
<b>So I'm counting on you!</b>

14:29.080 --> 14:31.580
<b>I have faith in you, Mr. Hero.</b>

14:32.080 --> 14:33.080
<b>Now go!</b>

14:33.080 --> 14:35.710
<b>Give these morons a taste
of their own medicine!</b>

14:36.920 --> 14:39.670
<b>Nosy bitch!
Why don't you mind your own busi-</b>

15:34.500 --> 15:36.380
<b>No going back, Max!</b>

15:36.380 --> 15:38.420
<b>Now give us your best shot!</b>

16:11.500 --> 16:13.960
<b>Dammit, Boss...!</b>

16:16.630 --> 16:18.040
<b>A kid...?</b>

16:21.290 --> 16:24.040
<b>Can you hear me? Are you alright?</b>

16:24.580 --> 16:27.580
<b>Y-yes... No need to fret...</b>

16:28.040 --> 16:30.920
<b>You're the young man from before, right...?</b>

16:30.920 --> 16:32.080
<b>What?</b>

16:32.880 --> 16:35.000
<b>Wait, what happened to Max?!</b>

16:35.000 --> 16:35.830
<b>Huh?
</b><b>Do you have a smartphone or something?!</b><b></b>

16:35.830 --> 16:37.580
<b>Do you have a smartphone or something?!</b>

16:53.170 --> 16:54.710
<b>How about it, Max?!</b>

16:54.710 --> 16:56.420
<b>Think you can defeat me?!</b>

16:56.420 --> 16:58.790
<b>Before Maximum Drive wears off?!</b>

16:58.790 --> 17:00.710
<b>Can you take me down?!</b>

17:00.710 --> 17:02.500
<b>SHUT UP!</b>

17:02.500 --> 17:05.080
<b>Quit yer yappin' already, ya stupid prick!</b>

17:05.080 --> 17:06.710
<b>Kick his ass!</b>

17:06.880 --> 17:09.500
<b>Hmm... This wire goes over here...</b>

17:14.920 --> 17:17.420
<b>What the hell's wrong with you two...?</b>

17:18.960 --> 17:22.750
<b>Why are we fighting like a bunch
of schoolyard children...?</b>

17:23.500 --> 17:28.250
<b>Leo, you started this whole thing
by defying the Kingdom...</b>

17:28.710 --> 17:32.790
<b>Max, if you had just cooperated
with us in the first place,</b>

17:32.790 --> 17:36.040
<b>we could've solved this without
having to pulverize each other...</b>

17:37.500 --> 17:39.250
<b>Be serious for once...</b>

17:39.540 --> 17:41.750
<b>How do you plan on fixing this?</b>

17:41.750 --> 17:46.790
<b>Max, let's assume you manage to beat us.
What will it change?</b>

17:46.790 --> 17:50.420
<b>Are you going to take my place
as the Kingdom's lapdog?</b>

17:50.420 --> 17:52.920
<b>Same goes for you, Yuria...</b>

17:53.210 --> 17:56.170
<b>Why am I surrounded by
the biggest idiots on the planet?!</b>

18:05.000 --> 18:06.880
<b>Am I the idiot...?</b>

18:43.670 --> 18:46.460
<b>M-Max...</b>

18:52.080 --> 18:54.580
<b>Selfish, inconsiderate bastards...</b>

18:55.830 --> 18:58.040
<b>every last one of you!</b>

19:08.130 --> 19:10.170
<b>I'VE HAD ENOUGH!</b>

19:10.170 --> 19:12.580
<b>DROP DEAD, YOU FUCKING IDIOTS!</b>

19:25.040 --> 19:26.380
<b>What the-?!</b>

19:38.330 --> 19:42.250
<b>Y-you... You really ARE...</b>

19:59.040 --> 20:01.710
<b>O-ow...!</b>

20:01.710 --> 20:04.460
<b>Oh god, everything hurts...</b>

20:07.420 --> 20:10.380
<b>H-he did it! The Hero won!</b>

20:10.380 --> 20:13.670
<b>But, uh... are we sure that's a good thing...?</b>

20:13.670 --> 20:16.580
<b>What now? I mean, what's the
Kingdom going to do...?</b>

20:23.630 --> 20:25.500
<b>C'mere...</b>

20:33.000 --> 20:35.960
<b>Let's see... Camera, camera...</b>

20:35.960 --> 20:37.790
<b>Oh, up there...</b>

20:52.000 --> 20:53.750
<b>I'm so sorry!</b>

20:54.250 --> 20:57.710
<b>I'M SO SORRY FOR EVERYTHING!</b>

20:57.710 --> 20:59.210
<b>Huh...?!</b>

20:59.210 --> 21:00.710
<b>What...?!</b>

21:01.330 --> 21:03.710
<b>My... my friends...</b>

21:03.710 --> 21:07.210
<b>...they made a huge mess
and dragged everyone into it!</b>

21:07.210 --> 21:09.420
<b>And I am so, so sorry!</b>

21:09.420 --> 21:11.830
<b>But... but please...</b>

21:12.630 --> 21:14.830
<b>...everyone who's watching this...</b>

21:15.250 --> 21:17.290
<b>...tell me what the solution is!</b>

21:17.290 --> 21:19.290
<b>I need to know the answer!</b>

21:27.710 --> 21:30.880
<b>Hm? What the heck is Max doing...?</b>

21:44.920 --> 21:49.040
<b>So that my friends won't
have to fight anymore...</b>

21:49.630 --> 21:51.080
<b>I'm begging you!</b>

21:51.080 --> 21:54.880
<b>There HAS to be a way for us
to settle this without violence!</b>

21:55.830 --> 21:57.250
<b>Please!</b>

21:57.830 --> 21:59.580
<b>I'll do anything!</b>

21:59.580 --> 22:01.290
<b>Just help me, please!</b>

22:01.670 --> 22:04.420
<b>Please... Please!</b>

22:04.420 --> 22:07.250
<b>Do something, please!</b>

22:07.250 --> 22:10.790
<b>Please! PLEASE!</b>
